      "height": 260,
      "text": "## Status legend (Histos)\n\n| Color | Status |\n|---|---|\n| 🟣 purple | Backlog |\n| 🟠 orange | In progress |\n| 🔴 red | Blocked (derived, don't assign by hand) |\n| 🟡 yellow | Proposal pending review |\n| 🔵 cyan | Dependency change request |\n| 🟢 green | Approved |\n\nDetail: docs/canvas-schema.md in the Histos repo.\n"
